BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:acd134a8a709f1da2b1b8e7d
SUMMARY:O Christmas Tea: A British Comedy 
DTSTAMP:20260830T080329Z
DTSTART:20261129T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:Fans of Monty Python\, Mr. Bean\, and Dr. Seuss… Grab your teac
	ups! Combining British propriety with an unabashed love for the unexpected
	\, London’s three-time Impresario Award-winning duo steep an outrageously 
	funny and brilliantly inventive show reminiscent of classic British pantos
	. Rich in wordplay\, comic physicality\, and cleverly crafted interactive 
	elements\, O Christmas Tea is uproarious fun\, yet it is the duo’s boundle
	ss imagination and endearing chemistry that provide the real magic and hea
	rt of this play. When catastrophe strikes at James and Jamesy’s Christmas 
	tea party\, flooding the world with tea\, the duo conjure wildly funny sol
	utions to stay afloat\, and sweep the audience out to sea in a jolly aquat
	ic escapade brimming with whimsy\, action\, and ingenuity in a celebration
	 of friendship at Christmas. “Complete and utter fun… for all ages.” ★★★★★
	 CBC “Outrageously funny\, magnificently written\, beautifully choreograph
	ed.” ★★★★★ London Free Press “An ode to the idea that anything is possible
	.” ★★★★★ Torontoist “I cannot think of a show that will leave you more pro
	foundly happy than this.” ★★★★★ Stage Door Hailed as “a child’s imaginatio
	n on steroids” by London Free Press and “a masterpiece of physical comedy”
	 by Theatre In London\, critics rave for the charismatic James & Jamesy. A
	 must-see performance on the international comedy circuit since 2015\, thi
	s unstoppable duo is regarded as “one of the most popular fringe duos ever
	” (CBC). If the cost is beyond your means\, we invite you to select the Su
	bsidized Ticket option Can't make it on November 28-29? Nov 24: Muncie\, I
	N Dec 19: Dayton\, OH Visit OChristmasTea.com for the full 60-city tour!\n
	\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/o-christmas-tea-a-british-c
	omedy
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/o-christmas-tea-a-british-
	comedy
LOCATION:Jarson-Kaplan Theater\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Comedy
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:155a98c46477fffcb9e94652
SUMMARY:Sister's Christmas Catechism
DTSTAMP:20260830T080329Z
DTSTART:20261206T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:It's "CSI: Bethlehem" in this holiday mystery extravaganza by t
	he author of the Late Nite Catechism series\, as Sister takes on the myste
	ry that has intrigued historians throughout the ages—whatever happened to 
	the Magi's gold? Retelling the story of the nativity as only Sister can\, 
	this hilarious holiday production is bound to become a yearly classic. Bri
	ng your cameras\, because in Sister’s Nativity\, your mother might be cast
	 as the Virgin Mary or your husband as the Ass!\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatia
	rts.org/events/detail/sisters-christmas-catechism-3
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/sisters-christmas-catechis
	m-3
LOCATION:Jarson-Kaplan Theater\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Comedy
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4b07c85508cf345756ffdcdf
SUMMARY:Rocky Mountain High Experience®: John Denver Christmas
DTSTAMP:20260830T080329Z
DTSTART:20261218T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to fall in love with the holidays all over again! Roc
	ky Mountain High Experience®: A John Denver Christmas takes you back to th
	e 1970s\, a golden era when John Denver's music lit up the airwaves and wa
	rmed hearts across America. Acclaimed performer Rick Schuler brings it all
	 back to life in a holiday concert you'll be talking about long after the 
	season ends. Sing along to the Denver classics you know by heart: "Rocky M
	ountain High\," "Take Me Home\, Country Roads\," "Annie's Song\," and "Sun
	shine on My Shoulders." Then comes the holiday magic as the evening pays l
	oving tribute to Denver's legendary Christmas specials with seasonal treas
	ures like "Aspenglow\," "Silent Night\," "Joy to the World\," and "Chestnu
	ts Roasting on an Open Fire" - the perfect soundtrack to the most wonderfu
	l time of the year. Lifelong superfan or first-time listener\, it doesn't 
	matter. You'll walk out inspired\, uplifted\, and full of holiday cheer. T
	his is a celebration for all ages and one show this season you won't want 
	to miss. Come experience the magic of John Denver\, live!\n\nhttps://www.c
	incinnatiarts.org/events/detail/rocky-mountain-high-experience-john-denver
	-christmas-26
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/rocky-mountain-high-experi
	ence-john-denver-christmas-26
LOCATION:Jarson-Kaplan Theater\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Comedy
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
